ESP32-S3R8 BASED DESIGN (AVOID STRAPPING PINS IO0, IO3, IO45, IO46 AT ALL COSTS):
GPIOs 26 TO 32 USED FOR EXTERNAL FLASH MEMORY Winbond W25Q128JVSIQ
GPIOs 33 TO 37 USED BY INTERNAL PSRAM -> LEFT UNCONNECTED
GPIOs 22 TO 25 DON'T EXIST ON THE ESP32-S3

ILI9341 SCREEN:
CS IO2 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
RST GPA2
DC IO5
MOSI MOSIB
SCK SCKB
LED IO11 TRANSISTOR DRIVER IN SCREEN SHIELD
MISO MISOB

TOUCH CONTROLLER:
CLK SCKB
CS IO6 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
DIN MOSIB
DO MISOB
IRQ GPB4

SD CARD:
DAT2 10KOHM TO 3V3
DAT3/CD IO17 PULLED-UP TO 3V3 VIA 10KOHM
CMD MOSIA
CLK SCKA
VSS GND
DAT0 MISOA PULLED-UP TO 3V3 VIA 10KOHM
DAT1 10KOHM TO 3V3
DET GPB6

EXTERNAL HEADER FOR I2C PERIPHERALS (SCL, SDA):
MTDO/IO40 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 2.2KOHM PULL-UP
MTMS/IO42 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 2.2KOHM PULL-UP

I2S MICROPHONE (SPH0645LM4H):
BCLK IO4 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
WS IO1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DATA IO8 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 100KOHM TO GND
SEL GND

AUDIO AMPLIFIER (MAXIM MAX98357AETE+T):
DIN IO21 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
BCLK IO4 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
LRCLK IO1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
SD_MODE GPA6 WITH 2.2KOHM SERIES RESISTOR
GAIN_SLOT HAS 3-POINT JUMPER TO SELECT BETWEEN VCC AND GND
VDD DECOUPLED WITH 100nF AND 2 x 10uF
OUTP AND OUTN TO AUDIO JACK

MEMORY (Winbond W25Q128JVSIQ):
CS SPICS0
CLK SPISCK
DI SPID
DO SPIQ
WP SPIWP
HOLD/RST SPIHD

BATTERY STATUS INPUT (FROM VOLTAGE DIVIDER):
IO9/BAT

USB-C RECEPTACLE:
USB_D-/IO19
USB_D+/IO20

GPS MODULE (L70-R):
TXD1 U0RXD/IO44
RXD1 U0TXD/IO43
WKUP GPA4
1PPS GPB3
RESET GPA3
SET 0OHM RESITOR TO GND
VBCKP POWERED FROM BATTERY TROUGH AN STLQ015M33R

LoRa MODULE (AI-THINKER RA-01SH-P):
MISO MISOA
MOSI MOSIA
SCK SCKA
NSS SPICLK_N/IO48 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
RST GPA0
BUSY IO7
DIO1 IO18 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DIO2 GPB0 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DIO3 GPB1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
RF_EN GPB2

GPIO EXPANDER (MCP23017_ML):
SDA MTMS/IO42
SCK MTDO/IO40
A0 GND
A1 GND
A2 GND
INTA IO10
INTB UNCONNECTED (REQUIRES TO SET INTA AND INTB TO BE MIRRORED IN THE CODE)
RESET SPICLK_P/IO47 PULLED HIGH TO 3V3 WITH 10KOHM
EP GND

THIS GIVES US GPA0-7 AND GPB0-7 IO PINS FROM THE EXPANDER

BUTTONS FOR GENERAL PURPOSE:
GPB7 TO GND UPON PRESSING
GPA7 TO GND UPON PRESSING


UNCONNECTED:
IO3 STRAPPING PIN
SPICS1
IO45 STRAPPING PIN
IO46 STRAPPING PIN
GPB5
GPA1


MISOA -> MTDI/IO41
MOSIA -> MTCK/IO39
SCKA -> IO38

MISOB -> IO12
MOSIB -> IO13
SCKB -> IO14


IO0 is pulled high and connected to a FLASH button to ground for flashing.
EN is connected to CHIP_PU, pulled high and connected to a button RESET that can pull it down to GND.
VDDSPI is decoupled to GND trough a 0.1uF, a 1uF and a 10uF capacitors.
XTAL_32_P and XTAL_32_N (GPIO 15-16) are tied to a 32.768kHz crystal.
XTAL_P and XTAL_N are connected to a 40MHz crystal.
GPA5 is connected to an LED.

BATTERY/USB POWER MUX TPS2116DRL WITH PR1 SET WITH VOLTAGE DIVIDER (22KOHM TO USB-5V, 8.2KOHM TO GND)
ST PIN OF TPS2116DRL CONNECTED TO A TEST POINT FOR DEBUG PURPOSES (PULLED HIGH TO VIN1 5V BY 100KOHM RESISTOR)
VOUT BULK CAPACITOR 22uF

LOAD SWITCH TPS22917LDBV
BATTERY CHARGE REGULATOR TP4055
VOLTAGE REGULATOR AP63203WU

